<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; even though =
\verb+\count0+ would {\em not} be reset at the</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; start of each chapter. =
Although (after the \lq\lq front matter'') neither</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \verb+\count1+ nor =
\verb+\count2+ would affect the printed</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; page-numbers, their =
settings would, for example,&nbsp; enable someone</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \begin{itemize}</FONT>

